31,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Now that the first night has passed, we must be more decisive.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I had a dream about a wolf! But I can't remember who it was!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I have information. Kenji is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,That was a very direct claim. Are you the Seer?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! Toshio, that's a lie! I'm not the wolf! Why would you say that?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Toshio, if you are the Seer, you've made the game very short. Is this certain?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, Toshio is so cool and direct! But is he telling the truth?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Yes, I am the Seer. My divination was clear. Kenji is the werewolf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a bold move. If Toshio is lying, he is likely the werewolf or possessed.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm not the wolf! Toshio is trying to trick us! Please don't believe him!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
