42,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I think we should trust Toshio! He seems so serious and reliable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I have no reason to lie. The evidence is absolute.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I find it hard to believe Kenji is the wolf based on his personality, but logic dictates we trust the Seer.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm just a kid! I wouldn't do that! Toshio is the bad guy!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I've observed both. Toshio's composure is consistent. I'll vote for Kenji.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
